    "detailed_description": "-This is retro classic arcade Full 3D shooting game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player is equipped with powerful, colorful missiles<br />\r\nIt provides cool action to destroy the pouring enemies.<br />\r\nWith the story of moving towards the moon<br />\r\nEach stage has a unique map composition and level design<br />\r\nIt's made to provide new fun every time.<br />\r\nIn the midst of ideological conflicts between characters<br />\r\nPlease be the main character.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can choose a combination of fighter jets and skills that suit your style.<br />\r\nChallenge and complete 43 unique stages<br />\r\nA target mission exists for each stage.<br />\r\nEnjoy the wonderful storyline from Earth to the moon.<br />\r\nEnjoy the battle with the giant boss<br />\r\nAs we progress through the stage, we provide fighter jets and skills at no special cost.<br />\r\nFighter and skill upgrades can help you become more powerful.<br />\r\nIf it feels too difficult, use the slow function.<br />\r\n.Data is not consumed during the play.",
